	"data": "Air Hockey (Redirect)\n\nThis was an incorrect concept note. Air Hockey MR is a full standalone Meta Quest 3 game, not a ThoughtBubbles testbed.\n\nSee: [[projects/air-hockey-mr]]\n\nThe Oct–Nov 2025 ThoughtBubbles work used air hockey game state as test data for the saving/loading architecture — but the game is its own separate project with its own roadmap, GitHub tracking, and Meta Store ambitions.\n\nSession History\n2026-08-19: Discussed air hockey testbed",
